218
00:14:05,390 --> 00:14:06,220
No.

219
00:14:06,640 --> 00:14:08,230
Keep it up, guys.

220
00:14:08,520 --> 00:14:09,730
Good, mate.

221
00:14:11,060 --> 00:14:12,230
Catch.

222
00:14:12,650 --> 00:14:13,730
