235
00:14:49,600 --> 00:14:53,650
Since number 20 arrived, France has become devastating.

236
00:14:53,730 --> 00:14:57,530
Yes, England's speed surprised them in the first half.

237
00:14:57,610 --> 00:15:00,030
But France has better talent.

238
00:15:00,240 --> 00:15:03,490
Seeing France doing well puts my mind at ease.

239
00:15:03,570 --> 00:15:04,410
Yes.

240
00:15:04,780 --> 00:15:07,080
A professional understands a professional.

241
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:12,540
Napoleon may have said he won't change his style for anyone.

242
00:15:13,080 --> 00:15:15,380
But he can collaborate very well with Pierre.

243
00:15:15,460 --> 00:15:18,920
