All these players are magnificent.

268
00:16:47,510 --> 00:16:51,100
Alright, I can't lose either!

269
00:16:51,180 --> 00:16:55,770
Guys, let's do our best, Japan will win this tournament.

270
00:16:56,350 --> 00:16:57,520
Tsubasa-kun.

271
00:16:57,900 --> 00:16:59,270
Tsubasa.

272
00:17:01,360 --> 00:17:03,610
Tsubasa-kun never changes.

273
00:17:08,110 --> 00:17:12,370
Now all together, Captain Tsubasa News:

274
00:17:10,320 --> 00:17:13,580
Captain Tsubasa News

275
00:17:13,660 --> 00:17:17,670
First International France Youth Tournament

276
00:17:14,790 --> 00:17:20,080
The first day of the International Youth Tournament in France has ended.

277
00:17:17,750 --> 00:17:20,080
End of the First Day

278
00:17:20,170 --> 00:17:24,920
Germany vs Canada

279
00:17:20,880 --> 00:17:24,920
In Germany's match against Canada, Germany won 4-0.

280
00:17:25,380 --> 00:17:29,550
The German nicknamed the Young Emperor, Karl Heinz Schneider,

281
00:17:29,640 --> 00:17:31,510
scored a hat-trick!

282
00:17:31,600 --> 00:17:35,560
He already declared his victory and says Germany has no rivals.

283
00:17:35,640 --> 00:17:39,850
We were impressed by his attitude and charisma.

284
00:17:39,940 --> 00:17:44,940
Uruguay vs Belgium

285
00:17:40,480 --> 00:17:44,940
Uruguay's match against Belgium ended 3-1 in favor of Uruguay.

286
00:17:45,530 --> 00:17:49,860
Victorino also scored a hat-trick in this match.

287
00:17:50,450 --> 00:17:55,700
France vs England

288
00:17:51,200 --> 00:17:55,700
France against England, the host France beat England 3-1.

289
00:17:56,120 --> 00:17:59,370
France's captain Pierre made three assists.

290
00:17:58,370 --> 00:18:01,790
3 assists

291
00:17:59,460 --> 00:18:04,710
And Napoleon scored a hat-trick with 3 goals.

292
00:18:01,880 --> 00:18:04,710
3 goals

293
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:07,920
Schneider and Victorino were on the field the whole time.

294
00:18:08,010 --> 00:18:11,720
I came on at the last minute, so this gentleman is the best.

295
00:18:11,800 --> 00:18:13,850
That's the interview of the man proud of himself.

296
00:18:13,930 --> 00:18:17,850
Pierre is great but Napoleon-sama is so magnificent.

297
00:18:17,930 --> 00:18:22,230
And Japan's first match against Italy was glorious.

298
00:18:22,560 --> 00:18:28,990
Japan won by scoring 2 goals against the flawless keeper Hernandez.

299
00:18:24,770 --> 00:18:28,990
Japan vs Italy

300
00:18:29,150 --> 00:18:34,370
Just before the end of the match, Kojiro Hyuga scored the winning goal.

301
00:18:35,030 --> 00:18:41,670
And the one who scored 1 goal and made 1 assist is none other than Ozora Tsubasa.

302
00:18:44,380 --> 00:18:46,550
On the second day we see more intense matches.

303
00:18:46,630 --> 00:18:50,930
In the first match, Germany beat Portugal 4-1.

304
00:18:51,010 --> 00:18:53,510
And they've already reached the safe point of the finals.

305
00:18:53,800 --> 00:18:54,850
We did it.

306
00:18:54,930 --> 00:18:57,430
We've reached the final matches.

307
00:18:58,020 --> 00:19:01,230
And their captain Karl Heinz Schneider

308
00:19:01,310 --> 00:19:04,520
scored a hat-trick in two consecutive matches.

309
00:19:04,860 --> 00:19:06,320
E-Extraordinary!

310
00:19:06,400 --> 00:19:08,360
Germany is too strong.

311
00:19:08,440 --> 00:19:09,400
Awe-inspiring.

312
00:19:09,780 --> 00:19:12,410
You're showing us your strength, Schneider.

313
00:19:12,660 --> 00:19:16,160
Now I understand why he's shown as the favorite for the championship.

314
00:19:16,990 --> 00:19:19,160
Karl Heinz Schneider.

315
00:19:23,710 --> 00:19:29,840
Are you watching, father, mother, Marie?

316
00:19:31,420 --> 00:19:36,720
Our German youth's Schneider has scored another hat-trick.

317
00:19:37,350 --> 00:19:39,560
Well done, Karl.

318
00:19:43,310 --> 00:19:45,810
Your son is extraordinary.

319
00:19:46,360 --> 00:19:48,320
Oh, yes...

320
00:19:48,570 --> 00:19:51,070
Wow, your big brother is amazing, Marie.

321
00:19:51,490 --> 00:19:52,570
Hmm.

322
00:19:54,450 --> 00:19:55,820
Alright, get ready.

323
00:19:56,070 --> 00:19:57,620
Bring the ball to me.

324
00:19:57,700 --> 00:20:00,330
I want to score my second hat-trick too.

325
00:20:00,410 --> 00:20:01,580
Okay.

326
00:20:04,370 --> 00:20:06,170
- We did it! - We won!

327
00:20:06,250 --> 00:20:08,090
Your shot was great, Victorino!

328
00:20:08,290 --> 00:20:12,300
Uruguay youth beat the strong opponent Spain 1-0.

329
00:20:12,380 --> 00:20:14,590
And they advanced to the final matches.

330
00:20:14,840 --> 00:20:18,680
Despite Spain tightly marking Ramon Victorino,

331
00:20:18,760 --> 00:20:22,100
he managed to score 1 goal but couldn't complete a hat-trick.

332
00:20:23,810 --> 00:20:27,110
I have to settle this with Schneider in the final matches.

333
00:20:27,520 --> 00:20:31,570
In the third match, England beat Costa Rica 2-0.

334
00:20:31,650 --> 00:20:35,200
The French team that beat England yesterday in Group C

335
00:20:35,280 --> 00:20:38,240
is one of the strong candidates advancing to the final matches.

336
00:20:38,410 --> 00:20:40,370
We have an easy opponent tomorrow.

337
00:20:40,830 --> 00:20:44,080
I can rest on the bench if you want.

338
00:20:45,670 --> 00:20:50,000
And now the fourth match, Argentina against Italy, is starting.

339
00:20:51,050 --> 00:20:53,840
Argentina youth enter the field.

340
00:20:54,630 --> 00:20:57,890
Finally it's our turn.

341
00:20:58,390 --> 00:21:01,430
And their opponent the Italy team enters.

342
00:21:02,220 --> 00:21:04,140
Hey, look over there!

343
00:21:04,230 --> 00:21:05,270
He...

344
00:21:06,060 --> 00:21:10,270
Italy's flawless keeper Gino Hernandez is on the bench.

345
00:21:10,730 --> 00:21:15,030
In the match against Japan, while resisting Tsubasa and Hyuga's shots,

346
00:21:15,190 --> 00:21:19,030
the middle and index fingers of his famous golden right hand were broken.

347
00:21:19,240 --> 00:21:22,040
Doctors say a full recovery requires a month.

348
00:21:22,490 --> 00:21:24,540
If Hernandez isn't playing...

349
00:21:24,620 --> 00:21:27,330
Then Argentina definitely has the advantage.

350
00:21:28,290 --> 00:21:29,790
Hernandez...

351
00:21:30,750 --> 00:21:35,550
Well, I really had wanted to play against him.

352
00:21:36,170 --> 00:21:42,220
Anyway, Argentina will win regardless.

353
00:21:43,260 --> 00:21:47,690
Argentina vs Italy, the match begins.

354
00:21:49,400 --> 00:21:53,570
~Suburbs of Paris - France~

355
00:21:51,020 --> 00:21:56,570
The match is over! The kids from Sao Paulo, Brazil won 3-1.

356
00:21:56,780 --> 00:21:58,860
Hooray! We won!

357
00:21:58,950 --> 00:22:01,030
We won all three matches!

358
00:22:01,120 --> 00:22:02,700
We won, coach.

359
00:22:02,950 --> 00:22:05,870
Coach! Coach, Roberto!

360
00:24:45,110 --> 00:24:49,990
